{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-js","path":"/dockerizing-microservices-nginx-load-balancing/","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"html":"<p>Zero-downtime rolling updates ensure that user sessions are never severed during active code pushes or configuration changes.</p>\n<p>In this guide, I share the multi-stage Docker configurations and NGINX upstream proxy architectures we deployed across our SaaS backends.</p>\n<h2 id=\"multi-stage-dockerfile-for-nodejs-services\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#multi-stage-dockerfile-for-nodejs-services\" aria-label=\"multi stage dockerfile for nodejs services permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Multi-Stage Dockerfile for Node.js Services</h2>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"dockerfile\"><pre class=\"language-dockerfile\"><code class=\"language-dockerfile\"><span class=\"token comment\"># Stage 1: Build &amp; Prune</span>\n<span class=\"token instruction\"><span class=\"token keyword\">FROM</span> node:20-alpine <span class=\"token keyword\">AS</span> builder</span>\n<span class=\"token instruction\"><span class=\"token keyword\">WORKDIR</span> /app</span>\n<span class=\"token instruction\"><span class=\"token keyword\">COPY</span> package*.json ./</span>\n<span class=\"token instruction\"><span class=\"token keyword\">RUN</span> npm ci</span>\n<span class=\"token instruction\"><span class=\"token keyword\">COPY</span> . .</span>\n<span class=\"token instruction\"><span class=\"token keyword\">RUN</span> npm run build</span>\n<span class=\"token instruction\"><span class=\"token keyword\">RUN</span> npm prune --production</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># Stage 2: Minimal Production Image</span>\n<span class=\"token instruction\"><span class=\"token keyword\">FROM</span> node:20-alpine</span>\n<span class=\"token instruction\"><span class=\"token keyword\">WORKDIR</span> /app</span>\n<span class=\"token instruction\"><span class=\"token keyword\">USER</span> node</span>\n<span class=\"token instruction\"><span class=\"token keyword\">COPY</span> <span class=\"token options\"><span class=\"token property\">--from</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">builder</span> <span class=\"token property\">--chown</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">node:node</span></span> /app/dist ./dist</span>\n<span class=\"token instruction\"><span class=\"token keyword\">COPY</span> <span class=\"token options\"><span class=\"token property\">--from</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">builder</span> <span class=\"token property\">--chown</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">node:node</span></span> /app/node_modules ./node_modules</span>\n<span class=\"token instruction\"><span class=\"token keyword\">COPY</span> <span class=\"token options\"><span class=\"token property\">--from</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">builder</span> <span class=\"token property\">--chown</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">node:node</span></span> /app/package.json ./package.json</span>\n\n<span class=\"token instruction\"><span class=\"token keyword\">EXPOSE</span> 3000</span>\n<span class=\"token instruction\"><span class=\"token keyword\">CMD</span> [<span class=\"token string\">\"node\"</span>, <span class=\"token string\">\"dist/main.js\"</span>]</span></code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"nginx-upstream-configuration\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#nginx-upstream-configuration\" aria-label=\"nginx upstream configuration permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>NGINX Upstream Configuration</h2>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"nginx\"><pre class=\"language-nginx\"><code class=\"language-nginx\"><span class=\"token directive\"><span class=\"token keyword\">upstream</span> node_cluster</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token directive\"><span class=\"token keyword\">least_conn</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token directive\"><span class=\"token keyword\">server</span> 127.0.0.1:3001 max_fails=3 fail_timeout=10s</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token directive\"><span class=\"token keyword\">server</span> 127.0.0.1:3002 max_fails=3 fail_timeout=10s</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token directive\"><span class=\"token keyword\">keepalive</span> <span class=\"token number\">32</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token directive\"><span class=\"token keyword\">server</span></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token directive\"><span class=\"token keyword\">listen</span> <span class=\"token number\">80</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token directive\"><span class=\"token keyword\">server_name</span> api.platform.com</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token directive\"><span class=\"token keyword\">location</span> /</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token directive\"><span class=\"token keyword\">proxy_pass</span> http://node_cluster</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"token directive\"><span class=\"token keyword\">proxy_http_version</span> 1.1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"token directive\"><span class=\"token keyword\">proxy_set_header</span> Connection <span class=\"token string\">\"\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"token directive\"><span class=\"token keyword\">proxy_set_header</span> Host <span class=\"token variable\">$host</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"token directive\"><span class=\"token keyword\">proxy_set_header</span> X-Real-IP <span class=\"token variable\">$remote_addr</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"token directive\"><span class=\"token keyword\">proxy_set_header</span> X-Forwarded-For <span class=\"token variable\">$proxy_add_x_forwarded_for</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>","excerpt":"Zero-downtime rolling updates ensure that user sessions are never severed during active code pushes or configuration changes. In this guide…","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#multi-stage-dockerfile-for-nodejs-services\">Multi-Stage Dockerfile for Node.js Services</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#nginx-upstream-configuration\">NGINX Upstream Configuration</a></li>\n</ul>","fields":{"slug":"/dockerizing-microservices-nginx-load-balancing/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Dockerizing Microservices with NGINX Load Balancing for Zero-Downtime Deployments","date":"April 18, 2022","dateISO":"2022-04-18","updatedISO":null,"tags":["docker","devops","nginx","architecture","linux"],"categories":["Engineering","DevOps"],"description":"Step-by-step setup for multi-stage Docker builds, health checks, and NGINX upstream balancing for zero downtime.","comments_off":null,"dated":null,"thumbnail":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"fixed","backgroundColor":"#080808","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/07f5a193c5a1357203c0389b1002fb71/d431b/gcp.png","srcSet":"/static/07f5a193c5a1357203c0389b1002fb71/d431b/gcp.png 75w,\n/static/07f5a193c5a1357203c0389b1002fb71/60637/gcp.png 150w","sizes":"75px"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/07f5a193c5a1357203c0389b1002fb71/d75d1/gcp.webp 75w,\n/static/07f5a193c5a1357203c0389b1002fb71/c970d/gcp.webp 150w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"75px"}]},"width":75,"height":75}}},"socialImage":{"childImageSharp":{"original":{"src":"/static/gcp-07f5a193c5a1357203c0389b1002fb71.png","width":960,"height":960}}}}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/dockerizing-microservices-nginx-load-balancing/","previous":{"id":"fc7da73a-2b1c-5578-b1dc-ce2cf27d8380","frontmatter":{"title":"Designing Scalable Multi-Tenant SaaS Backends Supporting 300K+ Users","tags":["saas","architecture","rest","docker","nginx"],"categories":["Engineering","Architecture"],"template":"post","series":null},"fields":{"slug":"/multi-tenant-saas-architecture/"}},"next":{"id":"9003d3fb-5c61-55d7-8c00-a32442ca6f3e","frontmatter":{"title":"Building Real-Time Faculty & Student Analytics Dashboards with WebSockets & React","tags":["react","websockets","javascript","frontend"],"categories":["Engineering","Frontend"],"template":"post","series":null},"fields":{"slug":"/real-time-dashboards-with-websockets-react/"}}}},"staticQueryHashes":["924188448"],"slicesMap":{}}